{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Do not wait indefinitely after suspension or retry is selected.** The handler must finish before the selected outcome is processed, so a blocked `finally` or end hook can turn valid `PENDING`/`RETRYING` into a Lambda timeout. Bound cleanup using the remaining invocation time and force a retry before the deadline; add a non-returning-finally regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77L0ZZ","finding_digest":"d34970da8c622b783e59c3d63971052058c1ab1e1e5ea29410929a444e633510","finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","line":125,"observation_digest":"f9994c838c3fc04d7e0a75036778cfb03be0d20d0b1fac3261bf027b39eb6145","observation_id":"aro_v1_7gmuza4mh7ae27qkoubwo6gpwa","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","published_at":"2026-10-08T03:06:49Z","review_id":"arr_v1_c2usoqym5ckwbtcjab5hzdhwpt","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"4cc0f356ca4356dd098c503ca66555819d92391f","reviewer":"codex","start_line":125,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_lvad7gttxucz64vlxoak6kaquv","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T03:06:49Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
